# Frontend Rules

Feature-based structure: `src/app/`, `src/features/`, `src/components/`, `src/lib/`, `src/hooks/`.

Docs: `docs/frontend/`

- All server data via TanStack Query (`useQuery`, `useMutation`, query keys in `lib/query-keys.ts`)
- Forms: React Hook Form + Zod; never uncontrolled forms
- UI: ShadCN + Tailwind; modern SaaS dashboard (CRM/call-center quality)
- Components: small, typed, reusable; max ~300 lines
- Mobile responsive, accessible, consistent spacing/typography
- API calls only through `lib/api-client.ts` or feature `services/` — not inline in components
